msgstr "克隆 Git 仓库: `git clone {quickstarts-clone-url}` ，或下载一个 {quickstarts-archive-url}[存档] 。"

msgid "The solution is located in the `kafka-quickstart` link:{quickstarts-tree-url}/kafka-quickstart[directory]."
